1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[Neferpitou] Sire!

2
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
[opening theme music playing]

3
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

4
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
[singer singing in English]

5
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

6
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
AN X INDEBTED X INSECT

7
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,000
[narrator] Youpi's attack succeeded
in splitting up the Extermination Team.

8
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
[limbs whipping]

9
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
[narrator] He completely destroyed
the central staircase

10
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:56,000
and stood ready to engage
anyone who dared climb it.

11
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Behind him were Knuckle and Meleoron,

12
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,000
And below…

13
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:14,000
the ones hit at the closest range
by Youpi's attack were Shoot…

14
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
[narrator] …and Morel.

15
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
The rest is up to you.

16
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Knuckle.

17
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,000
[narrator] He couldn't say
Knuckle's name out loud.

18
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Huh?

19
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
This resistance…

20
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,000
That's not smoke.

21
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Get back here. You fool!

22
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:59,000
[narrator] After using
his own weapon as a decoy,

23
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Morel was left
with no alternative but to run.

24
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
However…

25
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:17,000
[Knuckle] Hakoware, Bankruptcy Chapter 7!

26
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Damn. I'm giving it all I've got
to send him flying over the horizon…

27
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,000
but he's just at 590?

28
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:32,000
[groans] Ten seconds
feels like an eternity right now.

29
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:39,000
[narrator] Hakoware, Bankruptcy Chapter 7
accrues interest as time passes,

30
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:56,000
[narrator] Youpi was enraged,
but was brought back to his senses

31
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Shoot realized
that this would be his signature move.

32
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,000
[growls]

33
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,000
[narrator] Sustained by adversity itself…

34
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Hmm?

35
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,000
[narrator] …Shoot took flight.

36
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:42,000
[Morel] Shoot, Knuckle.

37
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:57,000
I wanna give you guys a big hug,

38
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:01,000
and that's the only way I can think of
to make you let me.

39
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:06,000
[narrator] The massive amount of dust
that was created

40
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:10,000
helped diffuse Morel's smoky aura
throughout the palace.

41
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:26,000
When Youpi destroyed the central stairway,
Gon and Killua evaded the attack,

42
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:08,000
Ikalgo's ability lets him control corpses
like parts of his own body.

43
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:49,000
[narrator] It was then
that Killua found himself running.

44
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,000
Huh?

45
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,000
[Killua] What am I doing?

46
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,000
What's wrong with me?

47
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:49,000
[narrator] Naturally, he was
rather perplexed at his own actions.

48
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:19,000
Although his mind was in a panic…

49
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:28,000
his body continued to act
in a rational manner,

50
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:41,000
Combining speed with the utmost accuracy,

51
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:49,000
he eliminated
the two soldier Ants' options,

52
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:52,000
as well as their ability to fight.

53
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,000
[Killua] Damn it.

54
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
What the hell?

55
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,000
What have I done?

56
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,000
[gasps]

57
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,000
[Ikalgo] Killua…

58
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,000
you owe me one.

59
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,000
[narrator] As he began
to return to his senses,

60
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,000
various emotions swirled
inside Killua's mind,

61
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:47,000
but Ikalgo's words
were just enough to dispel the chaos.

62
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:02,000
Killua was focused once again
and perfectly in control.

63
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,000
located at both ends.

64
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:24,000
Unfortunately, they were
currently occupied by soldier Ants.

65
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:30,000
Ikalgo raced past the two Ants
as quickly as possible,

66
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,000
and at the very moment
that he finally reached the elevator…

67
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,000
-[door opens]
-Hmm?

68
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:48,000
and from the darkness,
two figures emerged.

69
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,000
[Ikalgo] Cheetu.

70
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,000
And Bloster.

71
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:21,000
The two soldier Ants saw an enemy,

72
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:25,000
sent out an alert,
and then died immediately.

73
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:30,000
The intruder who killed them
went back to where he came from.

74
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,000
The time between that
and Flutter coming down the hall,

75
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:09,000
I mean, Leol's orders?

76
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,000
[Shaiapouf] How pathetic!

77
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,000
How do you qualify as a Royal Guard?

78
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,000
No.

79
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:11,000
He had an absolute ideal to live up to
with no room for amendment.

80
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:15,000
[Shaiapouf laughing hysterically]

81
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:22,000
Pouf, the former Royal Guard!

82
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:45,000
No, Pouf, scum of the earth,

83
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:49,000
the truth is
you just don't want to admit it.

84
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:56,000
You don't want him to be with that woman.

85
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:04,000
[narrator] His emotions were directed
at the King, as well as himself.

86
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:11,000
[Shaiapouf] An absolute King
feeling concern for a lowly human,

87
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:16,000
lowering himself to visiting the chambers
of human scum by choice.

88
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:31,000
You knew that much
even before you got here.

89
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,000
You fail as a Royal Guard

90
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:36,000
not because you didn't know
his whereabouts, far from it.

91
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,000
You fail, because you did know,

92
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:43,000
and in spite of that
you chose not to rush to his aid.

93
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,000
You're a traitor, Pouf.

94
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,000
You're lower than an insect.

95
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:01,000
You must devote yourself
solely to the King.

96
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:06,000
For the King. For the King.
For the King. For the King.

97
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:10,000
For the King. For the King. For the King!

98
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,000
For the King!

99
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
For the King!

100
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,000
[narrator] For a few brief seconds
after arriving in the throne room,

101
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:34,000
[Shaiapouf] I must go to the King's side.

102
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,000
Hey.

103
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Ignoring me?

104
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,000
[thuds]

105
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,000
Going straight to the King's side, huh?

106
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,000
Too bad for you.

107
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
I've got you closed in.

108
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,000
[Shaiapouf] Then I must ask,

109
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:10,000
would you please let me out?

110
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,000
[Shaiapouf] Spiritual Message!

111
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:00,000
He said he'd use it
to keep Pouf away from the King.

112
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:05,000
If it's covering
the entire third floor of the tower,

113
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:07,000
then the King and Pitou aren't there.

114
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:09,000
So where are they?

115
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,000
[gasps]

116
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:55,000
[wind blowing]

117
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:28,000
[upbeat music playing]

118
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:31,000
[Gon] Next time, "Divide and Conquer".

119
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:33,000
No! I don t want to leave you!

120
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:36,000
[Killua] It's okay.
We're connected by an invisible bond.
